  "dmNarration": [
    "Weapon racks line one chamber; the next smells of leather, fur, and dust. Old storage here still serves someone.",
    "The arrangement of the stored equipment makes it possible to examine one part of the room without disturbing everything else. You can check what is within reach, look for markings, or study the exits. Anything useful still has to be inspected before you decide to carry it away."
  ],
  "question": "Ringgo opens the cell lock with a twenty-three. Mirna, Nars and Nilsa step out alive. They need an escort to town. Mirna says Thel was killed and recalls a necklace hidden in her family’s ruined alchemy shop in Thundertree. With the crypt cleared, the armory can be inspected safely; you take two more cloaks and leave the weapon racks and pelts otherwise untouched.",
